{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Moles Mayhem</strong>, players take control of mining moles and enter a chaotic free-for-all battle where the goal is to <strong>poke</strong> your opponents (or friends) until victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poke or Be Poked</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use speed boosts to enhance your movement and gain the upper hand!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the holes scattered around the map \u2013 one slip, and you\u2019re history.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collide head-on? The drills will repel each other, and we can\u2019t guarantee what will happen next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Mole</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as different moles like <strong>Grandma Mole</strong>, <strong>Mr. &quot;Miner&quot; Mole</strong>, a dynamic father-daughter duo, or be <strong>Moley &quot;The Excavator&quot;</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw Your Friends into the Hole!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New maps, characters, and mechanics coming on the track!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>